1
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:06,603
Excuse me. Sorry to bother you.

2
00:00:06,803 --> 00:00:08,898
Yes, dear? Can I help you?

3
00:00:09,098 --> 00:00:12,684
I think I'm lost. I'm looking for a flower shop.

4
00:00:12,884 --> 00:00:18,253
A flower shop? There are many flower shops in this city. What is the name of the street?

5
00:00:18,453 --> 00:00:21,873
I don't know. It's next to a big burger place.

6
00:00:22,073 --> 00:00:24,724
Ah! Big Burger! It's on Green Street.

7
00:00:24,924 --> 00:00:27,803
Yes! That's it! How do I get there?

8
00:00:28,003 --> 00:00:31,451
It's easy. Go straight. Then turn left at the bank.

9
00:00:31,401 --> 00:00:35,247
Then go past the park. Green Street is on your right.

10
00:00:35,447 --> 00:00:40,504
Go straight... turn left at the bank... past the park... on my right.

11
00:00:40,704 --> 00:00:43,493
That's right. It takes about ten minutes.

12
00:00:43,693 --> 00:00:45,899
Ten minutes? On foot?

13
00:00:46,099 --> 00:00:48,826
On foot. Or five minutes if you fly.

14
00:00:49,026 --> 00:00:53,572
Ha! I'm a goose, but I don't fly. I walk. Thank you so much!

15
00:00:53,772 --> 00:00:56,088
You're welcome, dear. Good luck!

16
00:00:58,688 --> 00:01:01,997
Okay. The bank. Turn... left? Or right?

17
00:01:02,297 --> 00:01:04,262
Right. Right is right!
